    "title": "「Q」＆「A」",
    "url": "https://lineblog.me/kano/archives/13208456.html",
    "archive": "https://web.archive.org/web/20190517075041/https://lineblog.me/kano/archives/13208456.html",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "お久しぶりです、鹿乃です。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "好久不见，我是鹿乃。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "It's been a while, it's Kano."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "ブログを書くのは好きだけど、"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "虽然喜欢写博客，"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I like writing blog posts,"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "同じくらい書くのは苦手です。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "但同样也不擅长写。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "but I'm just as bad at writing them."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "短すぎたら雑って思われるかな〜とか、長すぎたら読みづらいって思われるかな〜とか色々考えて書いては消して書いては消して。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "“写短了会不会被当成偷懒呀～”“写长了会不会让人觉得难读呀～”，我总在心里反复琢磨，写了又删、删了又写。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I wonder if people will think it's sloppy if it's too short, or hard to read if it's too long, and I think of all sorts of things, writing and deleting, writing and deleting."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "ブログくらいもっと自由に、好きに書いたらいいのに！と我ながら思ってしまう鹿乃は、最近よく広告で見かけて気になっていた\"凪のお暇\"を読んで「わかりすぎてつらい」てなってました。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "连我自己都觉得：写个博客而已，明明可以更自由、更随心所欲地写呀！这样的鹿乃，最近读了一直在广告里看到、心里很在意的《凪的新生活》，直觉得“太懂了，好难受”。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I'm the kind of person who thinks \"it's just a blog, why can't I write more freely, however I like!\", and recently I read \"Nagi no Oitoma\", which I'd kept seeing in ads and got curious about, and I was like \"I relate so much it hurts.\""
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "空気は読むものじゃない！吸うものだ！なんて言ってみたいうおおおおおおおおお🔥🐟🐟"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "真想说出“空气才不是用来‘读’的！是用来‘吸’的！”这种话啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊🔥🐟🐟"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\"You don't read the air! You breathe it!\" I wish I could say something like that, uoooooooooo 🔥🐟🐟"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
